  <section>
    <h2>Behaviour in Amstelvar Avar2</h2>
    <p>
      Amstelvar Avar2 implements YSHA through separate serif-height axes for
      uppercase, lowercase, and figures. The transformation changes the
      vertical extent of horizontal serifs while preserving their attachment,
      proportion, and relationship to the stem.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Straight construction — H</h2>
    <p>
      H is a useful control: the horizontal serifs become shallower or deeper
      while the vertical stems and crossbar remain stable.
    </p>

